      "updated": 1781764220094,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* SPA: since video streaming website are highly interactive and navigation between \nlist and video pages are pretty common, persisting data fetched on \ndiscovery across page navigation will improve performance.\nWe will choose SPA, client can prefetch the metadata needed\nby subsequent watch pages, improving video start up time",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* SPA: since video streaming website are highly interactive and navigation between \nlist and video pages are pretty common, persisting data fetched on \ndiscovery across page navigation will improve performance.\nWe will choose SPA, client can prefetch the metadata needed\nby subsequent watch pages, improving video start up time",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
