    {
      "id": "Xjf4hT8FKDsEGGfIzfg60",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -531.4363287321069,
      "y": 367.6433662538051,
      "width": 813.1395874023438,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1884405898,
      "version": 1126,
      "versionNonce": 1769772996,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786550964729,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Functional requirements\n-- Registration & authentication\n-- Create and manage conversation\n-- Send message and receive streaming AI response via SSE\n-- Save all conversations with history\n-- Retrieve past conversations\n-- Stream response token by token\n-- Rate limit (request & token limit)\n-- Content moderation for harmful requests\n\n*** Non-functional requirements\n-- Availability (eg: 99.9%) => ~30*24*60*0.01 = max 43 minute downtime per month\n-- Latency: first token (wait time) < 2 second\n-- Scalability: 200M DAU, 20M concurrent conversation ==> ~10% concurrency\n-- Consistency: Zero message loss\n-- Cost effeciency: LLM API is expensive and should be optimized\n-- Security: e2e encryption for conversations\n\n*** Core entities\n-- user\n-- conversation\n-- message",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Functional requirements\n-- Registration & authentication\n-- Create and manage conversation\n-- Send message and receive streaming AI response via SSE\n-- Save all conversations with history\n-- Retrieve past conversations\n-- Stream response token by token\n-- Rate limit (request & token limit)\n-- Content moderation for harmful requests\n\n*** Non-functional requirements\n-- Availability (eg: 99.9%) => ~30*24*60*0.01 = max 43 minute downtime per month\n-- Latency: first token (wait time) < 2 second\n-- Scalability: 200M DAU, 20M concurrent conversation ==> ~10% concurrency\n-- Consistency: Zero message loss\n-- Cost effeciency: LLM API is expensive and should be optimized\n-- Security: e2e encryption for conversations\n\n*** Core entities\n-- user\n-- conversation\n-- message",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wx6bhKtbKJWz8B2JrxtB7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -581.5081241748928,
      "y": 232.10823432979237,
      "width": 904.6397500487958,
      "height": 775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1328062358,
      "version": 1882,
      "versionNonce": 1151243588,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786551849169,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Capacity & storage estimation\n-- 1 billion WAU.\n-- ~200million DAU\n-- 2.5 billion prompts/messages per day\n-- 12.5 message/user/days\n-- At peek hours (20% daily traffic ~69444 message/second)\n-- Concurrent converstion at peak: ~20million -- assume 10% of DAU are chatting\nsimunstaneously\n\n*** Storage per conversation\n-- User message: 100 characters === 100 bytes\n-- AI responses: 500 characters == 500 bytes\n-- Per exchange: ~600 bytes\n-- 12.5 exchange/day/user -- 7.5kb/user/day\n-- 200M DAU * 7.5KB - 1.5TB/day\n-- Annual: 548 TB/year\n*** Metadata storage\n-- User profile (assume 1KB seach) -- 1TB for 1Billion user\n-- Conversation metadata (500 bytes each, 10 per user average) -- 10B conversation *\n500B = 5TB ==> 1 year ~554TB (need distributed DB)\n*** Connection overhead\n-- 20M concurrent SSE connections at peak\n-- each connection: 10~30 second average ==> need infrastructure thatcan handle millions of\nlong-lived connection\n*** Bandwidth\n-- Average response: 750bytes streamed over 20 seconds\n-- 20M concurrent: 20M * 750B/20s == 750MB/s = 6Gbps\n-- Peak outbound bandwidth requirement\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Capacity & storage estimation\n-- 1 billion WAU.\n-- ~200million DAU\n-- 2.5 billion prompts/messages per day\n-- 12.5 message/user/days\n-- At peek hours (20% daily traffic ~69444 message/second)\n-- Concurrent converstion at peak: ~20million -- assume 10% of DAU are chatting simunstaneously\n\n*** Storage per conversation\n-- User message: 100 characters === 100 bytes\n-- AI responses: 500 characters == 500 bytes\n-- Per exchange: ~600 bytes\n-- 12.5 exchange/day/user -- 7.5kb/user/day\n-- 200M DAU * 7.5KB - 1.5TB/day\n-- Annual: 548 TB/year\n*** Metadata storage\n-- User profile (assume 1KB seach) -- 1TB for 1Billion user\n-- Conversation metadata (500 bytes each, 10 per user average) -- 10B conversation * 500B = 5TB ==> 1 year ~554TB (need distributed DB)\n*** Connection overhead\n-- 20M concurrent SSE connections at peak\n-- each connection: 10~30 second average ==> need infrastructure thatcan handle millions of long-lived connection\n*** Bandwidth\n-- Average response: 750bytes streamed over 20 seconds\n-- 20M concurrent: 20M * 750B/20s == 750MB/s = 6Gbps\n-- Peak outbound bandwidth requirement\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
