      "text": "Conversations\nGET /api/conversations\nGET /api/conversations/{convesationID} ==> return array of messages in conversations\nPOSt /api/conversations \nPOST /api/conversations/{conversationId}/messages\nDELET /api/conversations/{conversationID}\n",
