    {
      "id": "W7rdKI-c-ltK4amifz8xG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -522.0500769881643,
      "y": -1234.8165250910392,
      "width": 778.6623064602072,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 122165828,
      "version": 326,
      "versionNonce": 1292162300,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786551469243,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) The system should have low time-to-first-token (< ~500ms), with\ncontinuous, smooth streaming after that. A full response can take up to ~30\nseconds to finish generating.\n2) high availability >> strong consistency for conversation state (~99.9%+).\nIt's better to return an error or a degraded experience than to block the\nwhole system on perfectly synchronized chat state.\n3) scale under GPU-constrained capacity, with fair allocation across a tiered\nuser base (200M DAU, ~20k prompts/sec at peak, ~120k concurrent in-flight\nstreams).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) The system should have low time-to-first-token (< ~500ms), with continuous, smooth streaming after that. A full response can take up to ~30 seconds to finish generating.\n2) high availability >> strong consistency for conversation state (~99.9%+). It's better to return an error or a degraded experience than to block the whole system on perfectly synchronized chat state.\n3) scale under GPU-constrained capacity, with fair allocation across a tiered user base (200M DAU, ~20k prompts/sec at peak, ~120k concurrent in-flight streams).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
